{"text":"□□□年歲次辛亥，八月戊戌朔十五日壬子，〔道慧〕、法盛等二人敬造多寶像一區，仰爲七代父母、師僧眷屬。願使不墮三途，速□□□。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"道慧","refId":null,"text":"道慧","start":21,"end":23},{"name":"PersonName","term":"法盛","refId":null,"text":"法盛","start":25,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"多寶","refId":null,"text":"多寶","start":32,"end":34},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三途","refId":null,"text":"三途","start":54,"end":56}]}